Z||000008||DaRkLoRD||01-03-2000||06:23 PM||||Hmm. I see what you mean. Of all the new door designs I've seen, this one is my favorite.. a similar-styled one that was designed to work with the stock exterior panels would be preferable IMHO.<P>Another advantage would be that it could be used with most Fiero-based kits as well as stock.||||reg||1
